{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/823dfed8ea471ef7060d482844de61c1.avif?t=1764133519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras_big/823dfed8ea471ef7060d482844de61c1.avif?t=1764133519 width=800 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Worldview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Final Moment nears. Midgard, a land of war and faith, is a chessboard for gods\u2014their will seeps everywhere, with chaos, war, bloodshed and death raging across kingdoms. You hear the call, cross the Misty Sea to keep the ancient covenant: retrieve the gods\u2019 stolen fire, and find your answer in this land where good and evil blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/8811aa265df791a0b3fbbcba85cfd8e3.avif?t=1764133519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras_big/8811aa265df791a0b3fbbcba85cfd8e3.avif?t=1764133519 width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/b92fed994542d7b1edfa0d2ab8bc43af.avif?t=1764133519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras_big/b92fed994542d7b1edfa0d2ab8bc43af.avif?t=1764133519 width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Open-World Exploration</strong>\u00a0\u2014 Beneath the ruins lie forgotten histories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the four realms of the Kingdom of Serotania, and explore relics, dark forests, and sealed ancient roads\u2014each holds hidden secrets. Talk, investigate, and track; piece together fragmented histories and uncover the truth behind the upheavals of all kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/436ef66857f9f2bcffaefe50ec2e5ede.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/670844769152215137c1cea16bc8d8f8.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Economic System\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Choose your way to survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete commissions: Accept quests at the town steward's office and mercenary guild, but be cautious\u2014quests from the steward's office often come with danger. Alternatively, venture into ancient relics and forbidden lands to collect precious items, then sell them to merchants everywhere. This not only fills your pockets generously but also boosts your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/9238e3dacba44edb0386b5bb6b74e8e1.avif?t=1764133519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras_big/9238e3dacba44edb0386b5bb6b74e8e1.avif?t=1764133519 width=1560 height=866 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/1d4cfdcb27ca528583e5d2344306c694.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Character Growth</strong> \u2014 Your skills determine your life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no level system; your strength depends on mastering weapons and skills, and your growth is determined by your choices. With three categories of weapons and seven skill systems, seek out renowned masters everywhere to learn unique techniques and become a true tactical master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/8cdaa7f5f3f3c937e1fd0dc1fafa7ed2.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tactical Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2014 Formulate your strategy before sanity crumbles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies</strong>: Dark creatures, cultists, exotic beasts, and the undead\u2014each requires a unique strategy to counter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Choices</strong>: Carry specific items to avoid danger, or use skills to interrupt the enemy directly? A single move of yours decides life or death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/ca1da4a78093d92290e965612f8ebee2.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I\u2019m the developer of <i>Otherworld\u00a0Chronicles\u00a0</i>\u2014 a stubborn, passionate idealist. At 20, I chose to devote my life to making 37 games. Perseverance, I believe, frees me from mediocrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game currently supports only Chinese.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/d21338da68752e927a7e48d5b407a522.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Goal</strong>: Fully build Midgard (4 kingdoms\u2019 maps) \u2014 a years-long project.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Content</strong>: Features Serotania\u2019s Wenzel and Yinkedar realms; more via DLC/sequels later. It will keep updating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower stands under stars, divine fire burns on the monarch\u2019s throne. This page writes your fate...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/55e2776806b695693fe45463365f986a.avif?t=1764133519\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619460?t=1764133519","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/b872b29009d0ce5083f3bc29d9da996593961834/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764133519","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/48c2a220f7ee345d58d1f54bd8ba3ed996e64f82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764133519","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/48c2a220f7ee345d58d1f54bd8ba3ed996e64f82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764133519","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/