eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/2ccc950d38fc8e48ca3d75b2bb022c39213680a9/ss_2ccc950d38fc8e48ca3d75b2bb022c39213680a9.600x338.jpg?t=1764133519"}],"short_description":"Otherworld Chronicles is a text-based narrative RPG set in a dark fantasy universe. One who crossed the Misty Sea answering the call, I charge you to keep the covenant: Go to Midgard, climb the day-night dividing tower, reclaim the monarch\u2019s stolen divine fire, and free the gods.","steam_appid":3619460,"support_info":{"email":"service@eegams.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://www.eegames.com/Games/GameDetails?gameId=200002"}